  "body": "The sellers are motivated to make their move and have secured the next home.\r\n\r\nBig on space and even bigger on flexibility, this substantial home brings together expansive living, impressive outdoor connection and genuine options for multiple generations under one roof.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area feels bright, spacious and welcoming, with large windows drawing in natural sunlight and creating a warm atmosphere throughout the main living spaces. The modern kitchen is backed by an oversized walk-in butler's pantry complete with its own sink and cooktop, while multiple wide stacker doors pull back to connect the living spaces with the wraparound deck. High ceilings, extensive glazing and ducted heating and cooling add to the sense of scale throughout.\r\n\r\nSpread across multiple levels, the floorplan creates distinct spaces that allow different generations to live together while still having room and privacy of their own. Downstairs, a separate living area with its own entrance, double bedroom and bathroom creates an excellent option for extended family, teenagers or guests. Upstairs, four further bedrooms are joined by a third living area, including two master suites with fully tiled ensuites and walk-in wardrobes, while the main master opens to its own deck.\r\n\r\n* Grand scale multi generational living\r\n* Future swimming pool possible with plans available for the new owner\r\n* Separate downstairs living, bedroom, bathroom and private entrance\r\n* Two master suites with tiled ensuites and walk-in wardrobes\r\n* Main master with private elevated deck\r\n* Large modern kitchen with oversized island\r\n* Walk-in butler's pantry with sink and cooktop\r\n* Wraparound decks and wide-opening stacker doors\r\n* Ducted heating and cooling throughout\r\n* Automatic gate, double garage and excellent off-street parking\r\n\r\nTucked down a private lane in Millwater, there is a sense of separation here while still being close to local schools, parks, shops, motorway connections and the wider Hibiscus Coast. With serious space, multiple living zones and genuine options for multi-generational living, there is a lot of house on offer.\r\n\r\nSee you at the open homes to explore the space and see just how much this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/QMM6",
